<section class="harbor-mailbox" aria-labelledby="mailboxTitle">
  <details class="harbor-letter" id="guestbook">
    <summary><span class="harbor-letter__icon" aria-hidden="true"><span class="harbor-envelope"><i class="harbor-envelope__paper"></i><i class="harbor-envelope__flap"></i><i class="harbor-envelope__front"></i></span></span><span class="harbor-letter__summary"><strong id="mailboxTitle">留言</strong><span>聊两句，提个建议，或者申请友链。</span></span><span class="harbor-letter__toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
    <div class="harbor-letter__body">
      <div class="harbor-letter__aside"><p>留言会发到 GitHub Issues。<br />不方便登录的话，也可以发邮件。</p><a href="https://github.com/sunny-0501/sunny-0501.github.io/issues?q=is%3Aissue+%E7%95%99%E8%A8%80" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看已有留言 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <form class="guestbook-form harbor-note-form" id="guestbookForm" action="https://github.com/sunny-0501/sunny-0501.github.io/issues/new" method="get" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <label for="guestbookName">怎么称呼你<input id="guestbookName" name="title" type="text" maxlength="40" placeholder="你的昵称" autocomplete="nickname" required /></label>
        <label for="guestbookMessage">想说的话<textarea id="guestbookMessage" name="body" rows="3" maxlength="1200" placeholder="想聊什么？" aria-describedby="guestbookCount" required></textarea></label>
        <div class="harbor-note-form__bottom"><p class="harbor-note-form__hint">使用 GitHub 留言，需要登录后确认发布。</p><span id="guestbookCount" class="harbor-note-form__count">0 / 1200</span></div>
        <button class="publish-button harbor-send" type="submit">去 GitHub 发布 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        <p class="static-note">会先打开草稿，你确认发布后才公开。也可<a href="mailto:2522015679@qq.com">发邮件</a>。</p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>
